[{"id":"IU_2","ref":"2","section":"The eighteen mantras","sa":["कुर्वन्नेवेह कर्माणि जिजीविषेच्छतं समाः ।","एवं त्वयि नान्यथेतोऽस्ति न कर्म लिप्यते नरे ॥"],"iast":["kurvanneveha karmāṇi jijīviṣecchataṃ samāḥ ।","evaṃ tvayi nānyatheto’sti na karma lipyate nare ॥"],"alt":[{"text":"Doing verily works in this world one should wish to live a hundred years. Thus it is in thee and not otherwise than this; action cleaves not to a man.","by":"Sri Aurobindo","cite":"Sri Aurobindo · CWSA 17, p. 5","source":"upanishads.org.in"}],"words":[["कुर्वन्","kurvan","Doing","kṛ"],["एव","eva","verily","eva"],["इह","iha","in this world","iha"],["कर्माणि","karmāṇi","works","karman"],["जिजीविषेत्","jijīviṣet","one should wish to live","√jīv"],["शतम्","śatam","a hundred","śata"],["समाः","samāḥ","years","samā"],["एवम्","evam","Thus","evam"],["त्वयि","tvayi","in thee","tva"],["न","na","not","na"],["अन्यथा","anyathā","otherwise","anya"],["इतः","itaḥ","than this","itaḥ"],["अस्ति","asti","it is","√as"],["न","na","not","na"],["कर्म","karma","action","karman"],["लिप्यते","lipyate","cleaves","√lip"],["नरे","nare","to a man","nara"]],"tr":{"text":"By performing karma in this world (as enjoined by the scriptures) should one yearn to live a hundred years. Thus action does not bind thee, the doer. There is no other way than this.","by":"Vidyavachaspati V. Panoli","source":"108 Upanishads (comp. R. Sheppard)"},"audio":{"mp3":"https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/upanishaddata/SplitAudio/Isopanisad/1.2.mp3","whole":[26.44,42.66]},"hasBhashya":true,"order":3,"up":"isha"}]